Microsoft Defender Server Setup
================================
This server is prepared for Microsoft Defender for Endpoint management.
Configuration Status:
--------------------
- Windows Defender features: Enabled
- Real-time protection: Enabled
- Cloud-delivered protection: Enabled
- Network protection: Enabled
Onboarding Steps:
----------------
1. Access Microsoft Defender Security Portal:
   https://security.microsoft.com
2. Navigate to Settings > Endpoints > Onboarding
3. Download the onboarding package:
   - Select: Windows Server 2022 (or "Windows Server 2019 and 2022" for compatibility)
   - Download the .cmd or .zip package
4. Run the onboarding script on this server:
   - Extract the package
   - Run WindowsDefenderATPOnboardingScript.cmd as Administrator
5. Verify onboarding:
   - Run: "C:\Program Files\Windows Defender\MpCmdRun.exe" -CheckOnboarding
   - Check device appears in Defender portal (may take 5-10 minutes)
6. Test detection:
   - Run test file from: https://demo.wd.microsoft.com/
   - Verify alert appears in Defender portal
Advanced Configuration:
----------------------
For ADX/Log Analytics integration:
1. Create Log Analytics Workspace in Azure Portal
2. In Defender portal: Settings > Advanced Features
3. Enable "Azure Data Explorer connection"
4. Configure workspace connection
Useful PowerShell Commands:
--------------------------
Get-MpComputerStatus
Get-MpThreat
Start-MpScan -ScanType QuickScan
& "C:\Program Files\Windows Defender\MpCmdRun.exe" -CheckOnboarding
